    <string name="i_built_kompact_because_i_believe_essential_tools_should_be_simple_private_and_free_of_ads_or_tracking_i_work_on_this_in_my_spare_time_driven_by_the_idea_of_making_a_useful_utility_for_everyone">I built Kompact because I believe essential tools should be simple, private, and free of ads or tracking. I work on this in my spare time, driven by the idea of making a useful utility for everyone.</string>
